# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and set what this clone needs.

# Port of `pnpm dev` and `pnpm start` (default 3000), so each clone keeps its
# own without a flag. Next reads PORT only from the environment it starts in,
# so the two scripts read it from this file and pass it on (scripts/next.mjs);
# nothing else here is preloaded. `pnpm cv:pdf` prints from the same port. A
# number only — anything else is reported and the default is used. A PORT
# already in the environment wins.
# PORT=3000
